  - key: scan.looking
    text: Point at the floor. Move your phone slowly.
  - key: scan.keep_going
    text: Floor found. Keep moving to see more of it.
  - key: scan.found
    text: Ready. Tap the floor to place the scene.
  - key: scan.help
    text: Move your phone slowly. Find a floor with pattern or light.
  - key: place.too_small
    text: Too small. Find a clear space about 2 by 1.5 metres.
  - key: place.placed
    text: Scene placed
  - key: place.adjust
    text: Tap the floor to move it. Turn it with the buttons.
  - key: place.rotate_left
    text: Turn left
  - key: place.rotate_right
    text: Turn right
  - key: place.confirm
    text: Place here
  - key: mode.title
    text: Choose how to train
  - key: mode.practice_desc
    text: Hints on. No timer. Learn at your pace.
  - key: mode.assess_desc
    text: Timed and scored. Pass mark is 80.
  - key: mode.reposition
    text: Move scene
  - key: hud.step
    text: Step {0} of {1}
  - key: hud.pause
    text: Pause
  - key: hud.hint
    text: Show me
  - key: hud.shout
    text: 'Shout: Are you okay?'
  - key: hud.open_phone
    text: Open phone
  - key: hud.hold
    text: Hold to check
  - key: hud.hazards
    text: 'Dangers found: {0} of {1}'
  - key: hud.mistakes
    text: 'Mistakes: {0}'
  - key: call.title
    text: Emergency call
  - key: call.call
    text: Call
  - key: call.clear
    text: Clear
  - key: call.dispatcher
    text: '112: What is your emergency?'
  - key: call.pick_three
    text: Tell them the 3 things they need most.
  - key: call.send
    text: Tell them
  - key: info.location
    text: Where we are
  - key: info.casualty_name
    text: The man's full name
  - key: info.what_happened
    text: What happened
  - key: info.your_shift
    text: When my shift ends
  - key: info.breathing
    text: If he is breathing
  - key: info.weather
    text: The weather outside
  - key: meter.per_min
    text: per minute
  - key: meter.start
    text: Start pushing
  - key: meter.count
    text: '{0} of {1}'
  - key: meter.slow
    text: Too slow
  - key: meter.fast
    text: Too fast
  - key: meter.good
    text: Good speed
  - key: instr.hazards
    text: Look around. Tap the 2 dangers before you go close.
  - key: instr.response
    text: Tap both shoulders. Then shout to see if he answers.
  - key: instr.call
    text: No answer. Call 112 and tell them what they need.
  - key: instr.breathing
    text: Hold the button. Look, listen and feel for 5 to 10 seconds.
  - key: instr.compressions
    text: Not breathing. Push the middle of the chest 30 times, fast and steady.
  - key: instr.recovery
    text: He is breathing. Drag the glowing points to roll him onto his side.
  - key: hint.hazards
    text: Check the floor around him. Water, wires, glass, gas, smoke, moving things.
  - key: hint.hazards_one_more
    text: One more danger. Look behind and beside him.
  - key: hint.response
    text: Tap the left shoulder, then the right shoulder.
  - key: hint.shout
    text: Now press Shout.
  - key: hint.call
    text: Tap Open phone. Dial 1 1 2. Press Call.
  - key: hint.call_info
    text: 'They need: where, what happened, and breathing.'
  - key: hint.breathing
    text: Hold the button until it turns green, then let go.
  - key: hint.compressions
    text: Tap the lower middle of the chest. Aim for 100 to 120 a minute.
  - key: hint.recovery.near_arm
    text: Drag the near hand out to the side.
  - key: hint.recovery.far_hand
    text: Bring the far hand to his near cheek.
  - key: hint.recovery.far_knee
    text: Pull the far knee up toward you.
  - key: hint.recovery.roll
    text: Pull at the hip to roll him toward you.
  - key: hint.recovery.head_tilt
    text: Tilt the head back to keep the airway open.
  - key: fb.timeout
    text: Time is up for this step. Moving on.
  - key: fb.hazard_found
    text: Good. That is a danger.
  - key: fb.not_a_hazard
    text: That is not dangerous. Look again.
  - key: fb.shoulder_tapped
    text: Shoulder tapped.
  - key: fb.no_response
    text: He does not answer.
  - key: fb.tap_shoulders_first
    text: Tap both shoulders first, then shout.
  - key: fb.call_connected
    text: Connected to 112.
  - key: fb.wrong_number
    text: Wrong number. The emergency number is 112.
  - key: fb.help_coming
    text: Help is on the way. Stay with him.
  - key: fb.info_missing
    text: They need more. Where, what happened, breathing.
  - key: fb.info_wrong
    text: Only tell them what they need now.
  - key: fb.hold_short
    text: Too short. Check for at least 5 seconds.
  - key: fb.hold_long
    text: Too long. Never check for more than 10 seconds.
  - key: fb.is_breathing
    text: He is breathing normally.
  - key: fb.not_breathing
    text: He is not breathing. Start chest pushes now.
  - key: fb.rhythm_off
    text: Keep a steady 100 to 120 a minute.
  - key: fb.hands_off_target
    text: Push the lower middle of the chest.
  - key: fb.next_round
    text: Good. Keep going, another 30.
  - key: fb.drag_further
    text: Drag it all the way to the marker.
  - key: fb.limb_ok
    text: Good.
  - key: fb.wrong_order
    text: Not yet. Do the steps in order.
  - key: fb.wait_tracking
    text: Point the phone at the scene again.
  - key: pause.title
    text: Paused
  - key: pause.manual
    text: Take a breath. Continue when ready.
  - key: pause.tracking
    text: The phone lost the floor. Point it at the scene.
  - key: pause.resume
    text: Continue
  - key: pause.quit
    text: Stop and go home
  - key: pause.quit_title
    text: Stop this attempt?
  - key: pause.quit_body
    text: It will be saved as not finished.
  - key: result.retry
    text: Try again
  - key: result.title_assess
    text: Assessment result
  - key: result.title_practice
    text: Practice done
  - key: result.out_of
    text: out of 100
  - key: result.practice_done
    text: Practice, not scored for pass
  - key: result.pass_long
    text: PASSED. Ready for a course.
  - key: result.not_yet_long
    text: Not yet. Practise and try again.
  - key: result.time
    text: Time
  - key: result.mistakes
    text: Mistakes
  - key: result.hints
    text: Hints
  - key: result.branch
    text: Casualty
  - key: branch.breathing
    text: Breathing
  - key: branch.not_breathing
    text: Not breathing
  - key: result.avg_rate
    text: Avg per min
  - key: result.in_range
    text: Right speed
  - key: result.on_target
    text: On target
  - key: result.steps
    text: Steps
  - key: result.step_ok
    text: Done
  - key: result.step_time
    text: Out of time
  - key: result.step_fail
    text: Missed
  - key: result.tips
    text: Next time
  - key: result.next_course
    text: Ask your facilitator about a certified first aid course.
  - key: result.saved
    text: Saved to your history.
  - key: result.not_saved
    text: Guest attempt. Not saved.
  - key: step.hazards
    text: Check for danger
  - key: step.response
    text: Check response
  - key: step.call
    text: Call 112
  - key: step.breathing
    text: Check breathing
  - key: step.compressions
    text: Chest pushes
  - key: step.recovery
    text: Recovery position
  - key: tip.hazards
    text: Look all around before you go close.
  - key: tip.response
    text: Tap both shoulders before you shout.
  - key: tip.call
    text: Dial 112. Say where, what happened, and breathing.
  - key: tip.breathing
    text: Check for 5 to 10 seconds. Not more.
  - key: tip.compressions
    text: Push the lower middle of the chest, 100 to 120 a minute.
  - key: tip.recovery
    text: Arm out, hand to cheek, knee up, roll, tilt head.
  - key: fac.title
    text: Facilitator
  - key: fac.export
    text: Share CSV
  - key: fac.timeout
    text: Facilitator area closed after 5 minutes.
  - key: fac.empty
    text: No trainees on this phone.
  - key: fac.ready
    text: Ready for course
  - key: fac.not_ready
    text: Still practising
